{"annotations":{"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Search NYCHA contracts"},"description":"Search NYCHA (New York City Housing Authority) contracts (Checkbook domain Contracts_NYCHA). These are separate from citywide contracts and are reported at release / line-item granularity (purchase-order releases, funding source, program/project). Filter by fiscal year, vendor, purchase-order type, responsibility center, contract type, industry, amount, and date ranges (including approved date). Results carry a year field only when you filter by fiscal_year; without fiscal_year they carry no year or fiscal-year field. When the year matters, filter by fiscal_year (one call per year). start_date, end_date, and approved_date are per record.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"amount_max":{"description":"Maximum contract amount","type":"number"},"amount_min":{"description":"Minimum contract amount","type":"number"},"approved_date_from":{"description":"Release approved date range begin (YYYY-MM-DD)","type":"string"},"approved_date_to":{"description":"Release approved date range end (YYYY-MM-DD)","type":"string"},"award_method":{"description":"Award method code","type":"string"},"contract_id":{"description":"Contract ID","type":"string"},"contract_type":{"description":"Contract type code","type":"string"},"end_date_from":{"description":"End date range begin (YYYY-MM-DD)","type":"string"},"end_date_to":{"description":"End date range end (YYYY-MM-DD)","type":"string"},"fiscal_year":{"description":"Fiscal year, e.g. '2024'","type":"string"},"industry":{"description":"Industry type code","type":"string"},"other_government_entities_code":{"description":"NYCHA agency code","type":"string"},"page":{"default":1,"description":"Page number, 1-based (default: 1)","minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"page_size":{"default":50,"description":"Results per page (default: 50, max: 20000)","maximum":20000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"pin":{"description":"PO header ID / PIN","type":"string"},"purchase_order_type":{"description":"Purchase order type code","type":"string"},"purpose":{"description":"Contract purpose (contains match)","type":"string"},"responsibility_center":{"description":"Responsibility center code","type":"string"},"start_date_from":{"description":"Start date range begin (YYYY-MM-DD)","type":"string"},"start_date_to":{"description":"Start date range end (YYYY-MM-DD)","type":"string"},"vendor_code":{"description":"Vendor number / code","type":"string"},"vendor_name":{"description":"Vendor name (contains match). The vendor may be a reseller, not the product's maker.","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"search_nycha_contracts"}
